<newsitem itemid="30621" id="root" date="1996-09-03" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: TR European Growth full year revenue jumps.</title>
<headline>TR European Growth full year revenue jumps.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.97		   vs 1.75</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.8		    vs 1.7</p>
<p> Revenue before tax     2.7		    vs 1.6</p>
<p> Fixed asset income     4.1		    vs 2.9</p>
<p> Interest receivable    0.26		   vs 0.24</p>
<p> Gross revenue gain     4.4		    vs 3.1</p>
<p> Gross capital gain     42.1		   vs 12.8</p>
<p> Revenue after tax	1.8		    vs 1.1</p>
<p> Tax			  0.9		    vs 0.5</p>
<p>Attributable	     1.7		    vs 1.0</p>
<p>Transfer to reserve    0.7		    vs 0.02</p>
<p>Pay date		   November 1 1996</p>
<p>Div registration date  October 1 1996</p>
<p>NOTE - TR European Growth is an investment trust. Comparative figures have been restated.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
